tasks.prompt:
Re-read plan/cards.json exactly as draft-card-plan left it -- a fresh read_files, never a
summary or your memory of the prior card -- and independently hand-verify:
- the union of every card's coversObligations is exactly OBL-01 through OBL-18, none missing, none duplicated;
- every card whose coversObligations includes a documentation-only obligation (OBL-14, OBL-15, OBL-16 or OBL-18)
  covers ONLY documentation-only obligations, and declares testability not_testable;
- no two cards list the same file in filesLikelyTouched;
- the dependsOn graph is acyclic and the top-level `dependencies` array agrees with it exactly (same edges, no
  more, no less);
- every card's testability is not_testable (this plan touches no test/ file, so "testable" would be dishonest).

Then run the real `npm test` yourself in this session and confirm all 12 checks in test/plan.test.js pass -- do not
reuse a result from draft-card-plan's turn. If plan.complete is not already true and every obligation is genuinely
covered, set it to true. Do not add, remove or rename any card -- this is a verification pass, not a redesign.

